  "Description": "Applies an easing function between the keyframes of the animated Value input.\n\nThe Value input must be animated; the shape of each segment is replaced by the selected Interpolation. Without animation the value is passed through.\n\nSee also: [EaseKeys], [EaseVec3Keys], [EaseVec2]",
